        "1. Find common denominator 24: 7/8 = 21/24, 5/12 = 10/24.",
        "2. Add: 21/24 + 10/24 = 31/24.",
        "3. Divide by 3/4 → multiply by 4/3.",
        "4. Simplify: 31/24 × 4/3 = 31/18.",
        "5. Trap: In division by a fraction, multiply by the reciprocal."
